1
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,100
What if we did what has never been done before?

2
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:15,875
What if we used open public data to expose, square meter by square meter, the hidden mechanisms of an entire territory?

3
00:00:15,875 --> 00:00:23,587
In Corsica, housing price inflation, land grabs, and the enclosure of public space affect thousands of families.

4
00:00:23,587 --> 00:00:27,525
But for the first time, we are not leaving this in the dark.

5
00:00:27,525 --> 00:00:33,050
In 1755, Corsica created the world's first modern democracy.

6
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:40,912
Today, we are pioneering Democratic Initiative 2.0: the world's first open territorial audit experience.

7
00:00:40,912 --> 00:00:46,787
No rumors, no personal attacks: a complete diagnostic powered by Open Data.

8
00:00:46,787 --> 00:00:56,875
We cross-referenced thousands of official land transactions, corporate registries, and satellite imagery to create an authentic, verifiable intelligence database.

9
00:00:56,875 --> 00:01:00,375
Together, we are making the system transparent.

10
00:01:00,375 --> 00:01:06,887
Look: we trace real estate price inflation parcel by parcel using Ministry of Finance data.

11
00:01:06,887 --> 00:01:12,850
We reveal who truly owns real estate companies through public beneficial ownership registries.

12
00:01:12,850 --> 00:01:17,837
And we monitor coastal transformations year after year directly from space.

13
00:01:17,837 --> 00:01:20,900
This is an open invitation to the world.

14
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:29,950
For the survival and dignity of the Corsican people on their land, and for any community facing territorial erasure: join this unique experience.

15
00:01:29,950 --> 00:01:38,925
Access the complete open repository on GitHub at: github.com/fsucieta/fsucieta-corsica-audit.

16
00:01:38,925 --> 00:01:43,362
Take the data, analyze the evidence, bring your skills.

17
00:01:43,362 --> 00:01:46,387
Your screens are tools of liberation.

18
00:01:46,387 --> 00:01:51,562
Together, let's defend a people's right to exist and set a precedent for the world.
